<title>USA: Federal Reserve business loans rose in March 26 wk.</title>
<headline>Federal Reserve business loans rose in March 26 wk.</headline>
<text>
<p>ONE WEEK ENDED MARCH 19</p>
<p>(Seasonally adjusted, millions of dollars)</p>
<p> Business loans............804,300 up.......300</p>
<p> U.S. Govt securities......702,400 up.....2,400</p>
<p> Large time deposits.......534,600 down...5,200</p>
<p>ONE WEEK ENDED MARCH 26</p>
<p> U.S. commercial paper.....834,453 up ....6,719</p>
<p> Financial companies.......648,962 up.....9,478</p>
<p> New York business loans....45,601 up........68</p>
<p> Excluding acceptances......45,339 up........66</p>
</text>
